    &gt;pookjw/HermesEnabler&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;hermesenabler-2&#34;&gt;HermesEnabler 2
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.md&#34; &gt;English&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.ko.md&#34; &gt;한국어&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.zh-CN.md&#34; &gt;简体中文&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.zh-TW.md&#34; &gt;繁體中文&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.ja.md&#34; &gt;日本語&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.es.md&#34; &gt;Español&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.fr.md&#34; &gt;Français&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.de.md&#34; &gt;Deutsch&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;README.pt.md&#34; &gt;Português&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/image.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supported only on watchOS 27.0 through 27.3 beta 1.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;installation&#34;&gt;Installation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;install-the-ipa&#34;&gt;Install the IPA
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Download the IPA from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/pookjw/HermesEnabler/releases&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Releases&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install it with &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://sideloadly.io&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Sideloadly&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On your iPhone, open the &lt;strong&gt;Watch&lt;/strong&gt; app and install &lt;strong&gt;HermesEnabler2&lt;/strong&gt; from &lt;strong&gt;My Watch → Apps&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open &lt;strong&gt;HermesEnabler2&lt;/strong&gt; on your Apple Watch and follow the steps in the app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;build-with-xcode&#34;&gt;Build with Xcode
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;HermesEnabler2.xcodeproj&#34; &gt;HermesEnabler2.xcodeproj&lt;/a&gt; in Xcode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select your Apple Watch as the run destination and click &lt;strong&gt;Run&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open &lt;strong&gt;HermesEnabler2&lt;/strong&gt; on your Apple Watch and follow the steps in the app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;cautions&#34;&gt;Cautions
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In Sideloadly, disable &lt;strong&gt;Use automatic bundle ID&lt;/strong&gt; and use a fixed Bundle Identifier. Keep the same Bundle Identifier and Apple ID for every update so the app can retain its existing data and backup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Before deleting the app, always restore your MobileGestalt backup through the HermesEnabler2 app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;credits&#34;&gt;Credits
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This project incorporates code from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/sasobhabha/Gester&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Gester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use at your own risk.&lt;/p&gt;
